### redirect — active link (expects 302)
# @name redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{linkCode}}

### link-stats — daily PV/UV for a link
# @name linkStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/links/{{linkId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### link-stats — with explicit date range
# @name linkStatsRange
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/links/{{linkId}}/stats?from=2026-05-01&to=2026-05-29
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
